{"parse": {"title": "世界筹码-08", "pageid": 134944, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%AD%B9%E7%A0%81-07\" title=\"世界筹码-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界筹码-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界筹码</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.A7.E8.B5.8C.E5.AE.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"大赌客\">大赌客</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 大赌客</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">High Roller</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div><!-- Using template from Html:Custom_bg --><style>/* CSS Minified */.skin-huiji-dragonhide,#rain-background{background-image:url(https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/69/Cg-3_5_at_ys_baifuzhang.png)}#rain-background{filter:}</style><!-- Code above is based on Html:Custom_bg -->\n<div class=\"no-indent\"><div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">警局讯问室 9:00</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory baifuzhang gamepic 13.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png/110px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png/165px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png/220px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>一切都结束了。<br />\n在那场比拼后，米拉被解救，当地警局已将“监护人”带走，百夫长也拿回了那枚罗马金币。<br />\n当警方对百夫长的讯问结束时，她收到了一封信，是阿马多尔寄来的。<br />\n信上说，他希望百夫长能在离开老区之前，来看看他们。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">老区郊外 9:30</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory baifuzhang gamepic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png/110px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"117\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png/165px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png/220px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"534\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>老区的郊外荒凉如故，窄细的河流一如既往地流淌着，只有造币厂被暂时关停，不见白雾。<br />\n百夫长来到此处，她双手插袋，悠闲地往前走着，直至来到兄妹俩屋前。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“米拉，阿马多尔——咦？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>只是这次，那掉了白漆的房门并没有关上，轻轻地被风吹拂着。<br />\n百夫长往里面张望，瞧了瞧目之所及无人后，她咳了几下。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>？？？：</b></span>“啊——稍等！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>只听到“噔噔噔”几下脚步声，她便知道是谁来迎接了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“太好了……我就知道你会来！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">米拉房屋内</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory baifuzhang gamepic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png/110px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png/165px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png/220px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“嘿——我就说，难怪你们一开始没听见我的声音。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>百夫长站在杂乱的客厅，这里堆满了各种衣物、蛀了虫的木头家具、书籍们……完全不像她一开始来的时候那样。<br />\n米拉和百夫长到来前，阿马多尔还在到处整理着行李，忙得不可开交。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>阿马多尔：</b></span>“真……抱歉，麻烦来这边，我收拾一下。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>阿马多尔意识到自己在待客上的失职，赶紧将沙发上的旧衣服挪开，请百夫长坐下。<br />\n米拉拉着百夫长坐下，随后，她泡了一壶薄荷茶。<br />\n一样的茶，一样的沁甜，只是那缭绕的烟雾不再凝结在屋内，而是轻盈地散在了空中。<br />\n喝了一口茶后，百夫长忍不住对眼前的场景发问。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“这是……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“嗯……就是，就是你看到的……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>阿马多尔：</b></span>“我们在收拾行李，想要离开这里。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>米拉用力地点了点头。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“我……我们，在经过这件事后，终于下定决心要走了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>闻毕，百夫长挑了挑眉。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“有想好去哪吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“暂时还没想好，只是……嗯，我们想靠自己去探索更大的地方。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“我想去看……去居住，去生活在一个更少贫穷、更少歧视……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>阿马多尔：</b></span>“……还有更多可能性的世界，至少，去一个工作更好找的地方，也不用再担惊受怕。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>阿马多尔目光坚定，米拉则低下脑袋。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"text-align:center; border:1px dotted #bc9567; border-radius:3px; background-color:#bc956720; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><big><b>结局Ⅰ要求：前面的分支关卡中触发的“导向分支Ⅰ”次数大于1次。<br />如不满足，解锁结局Ⅱ。</b></big></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:1em\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #bc9567; padding: 0 5px;\"><big><b>---因之前的选择,后续故事发生了些许变化---</b></big></span><br /></div>\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"结局Ⅰ\">结局Ⅰ</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"结局Ⅱ\">结局Ⅱ</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"结局Ⅰ\">\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“也许我们想要的，对百夫长姐姐来说已经司空见惯了，但……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>米拉抬起头，认真地看着百夫长的眼睛。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“这次，我想自己去试试……我想相信自己，因为我见过你的模样。”<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"结局Ⅱ\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“但……我们也不确定是否真的能成行，外面很多人，有好人，也有很多坏人，我……也许我们没法应付……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“不，不过呢！”米拉似乎想到了什么，迅速振奋了起来。<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“我们会在出发前，去‘妈妈’那里祈祷！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“你看，前几次，‘妈妈’都奇迹般地回应了我！这次，我也想问问她这件事能否顺利成行，我……我还是期望得到她的答案和祝福……”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>听完后，百夫长露出了一个灿烂而自信的笑容。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“听起来真不错，看来，你们要展开一场新的大冒险了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“不用太担心，米拉和阿马多尔一定是足够幸运的，谁叫你们是我的粉丝呢～”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“不过，如果实在不放心，也可以摸摸这枚罗马金币，怎么样？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>说完，百夫长拿出了那枚历经波折的金币。<br />\n米拉将这枚金币捂在心口，闭眼紧紧握住一会儿，随后将它交还给百夫长。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“嗯！我愿意去相信……好运一定会常伴着我，就像它一直在你身边一样。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>百夫长认真地点点头，随即喝完了剩下的茶。<br />\n随后，她张开双臂，拥抱了米拉，并朝阿马多尔示意。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“那我就不打扰你们了，唉，离开了这么久，不知道贝利他们有没有想我……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“那个……百夫长姐姐，我……我想问你最后一个问题……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“嗯？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>米拉低着头，有些不好意思地绞了绞手，随后鼓足勇气地将问题问出。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“为什么……为什么百夫长姐姐看起来一直这么年轻呢？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“明明……之前马里奥叔叔说，他小时候看你的节目，你就是这样，现在他已经变成叔叔了，你还是这样……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>百夫长蹲下身来，拍了拍米拉的肩膀。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“我曾经遇见一个老人，我们互相交换了对方最珍贵的宝藏，我给了他金币，作为回报，他给了我一份大礼——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>自信昂扬的大明星眨了眨眼。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>百夫长：</b></span>“……他的礼物，便是这份永恒的19岁。当然，你也知道，金币只认我……怎么样，很划算的一笔买卖吧～”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她如实回答，但米拉听完后，却好像一个泄了气的皮球。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>米拉：</b></span>“什么嘛……我又不是小孩子了，不会再轻易被这种童话故事骗了……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>百夫长哈哈大笑，但她什么也没说，只是揉了揉米拉的头，便离开了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">索诺兰沙漠</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory baifuzhang gamepic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"117\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_baifuzhang_gamepic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"534\" data-file-height=\"568\" /></a></div>\n<p>百夫长离开米拉家，独自朝城外走去。<br />\n她走出老区的边界，走出了环绕着老区的仙人掌群，一个人走向了索诺兰沙漠，正如她来时那样。<br />\n从白天，到太阳落山，再到夜晚，内心的某种冲动驱使着她来到此地。<br />\n望着一望无际的沙漠和星空，她不禁停止了脚步。<br />\n好运是什么？是金币，是壁画的光环，抑或是另一种看不见，摸不着的东西？<br />\n这些问题会有答案吗？<br />\n……<br />\n没有人能回答她。<br />\n——或许，也不需要别人来回答。<br />\n百夫长捏着这枚自出生起就伴随她的金币，感到自己内心有些宽广、巨大的东西，像横亘在此地的索诺兰沙漠一般。<br />\n她冷静地站在沙漠中央，感受到那片无垠而广阔的世界，聚拢在自己脚下。<br />\n如果……她想，命运是一场赌局的话，那么，她一直以全部的世界作为筹码，毫无犹豫地将其押注。<br />\n不知为何，她坚信世界一定会站在她那一边。<br />\n所以，还需要拥有什么，才能获得好运呢？她向天空抛起那枚金币。<br />\n</p>\n——没有什么需要拥有的，祝我们好运。<br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界筹码-08"}}